<title>USA: Riddell Sports extends Varsity offer.</title>
<headline>Riddell Sports extends Varsity offer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sporting goods maker Riddell Sports Inc said that it has extended the expiration date of its tender offer for Varsity Spirit to 1100 EDT on June 19, 1997.</p>
<p>As of June 12, about 4.37 million shares were tendered, or 95.8 percent of Varsity Spirit's common stock.</p>
<p>Riddell has agreed to acquire Varsity Spirit for $18.90 a share.</p>
